<!--
  Synthetic off-route test track for Dystopo navigation (T61). NOT a recording.
  Made from skyline-loop.gpx (itself synthetic): its track points 52 to 66 (0-based) are moved east,
  50 m, 100 m, then 150 m and back down, and the line is resampled to one fix every 10 s (linear
  between the original points, same times and elevations), so a navigator following the Skyline loop
  sees the walker drift off the route for a stretch on the way down and rejoin it.
-->
